silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_25_six_step_bridge_deep_dives_sections_01_mereology_six_step_concrete_anchor_2#torsoregion_part silm:hasLongDescription "The TorsoRegion_part is typed part p_2: torso region of Mittens as a typed part-leg into the whole. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'TorsoRegion_part', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
